luscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620444_1767343591220275_1318459119071973556_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RgeLRJ7cl4UQ7kNvwFA8Vpv&_nc_oc=AdoPlkC9vMH8w_Yd0Bq0CGRQVRPy7ku3Y78audXGb7NKSmcyQtpv01t2T56-RGBw56M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIDvrYTExBvtRtNfnHu0GDidJ6AUURgghfJpO_FskoKHQ&oe=6AA15D65"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Push Em All! Clear the Blocks", "keywords": ["blocks", "puzzle", "tabletop", "board", "brain"], "long_description": "The Ultimate Physics-Based Block Challenge in VR!\n\nGet ready for a satisfyingly addictive puzzle experience with Push Em All! Clear the Blocks. Step into a focused virtual environment where your only goal is to clear the board by pushing every block into its rightful place. But be careful\u2014each move requires strategy, precision, and a bit of physics-based logic!\n\nEquip your high-tech pusher tool and start sliding blocks, dodging obstacles, and outsmarting the layout to become the master of the grid.\n\nWhy You\u2019ll Love the Challenge:\nSatisfying Physics Mechanics: Feel the weight and friction as you push blocks across the surface. The tactile feedback makes every \"clear\" feel incredibly rewarding.\n\nBrain-Teasing Puzzles: What starts as a simple task quickly turns into a complex puzzle. Plan your path to ensure no block gets stuck in a corner!\n\nStrategic Block Movement: Every block matters. Use your pusher tool to align them perfectly and slide them into the target holes to complete the level.\n\nImmersive Table-Top Design: Play in a comfortable, realistic 3D environment. The table-top perspective is perfect for both seated and standing VR play on Meta Quest.\n\nMaster the Board: Progress through challenging layouts that test your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills.\n\nGrab your Meta Quest controllers and see if you have the skills to Push Em All!", "short_description": "Push, slide, and solve! In Push Em All! Clear the Blocks, you take control of a powerful pusher tool to clear the grid. Use your strategy and physics to navigate blocks into their target slots. With satisfying spatial puzzles, can you clear the board and earn the trophy? It's time to push your brain to the limit!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "944790307951153", "locale": "zh_TW", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Push Em All! Clear the Blocks", "keywords": ["\u65b9\u584a", "\u76ca\u667a", "\u68cb\u76e4", "\u71d2\u8166", "\u7269\u7406"], "long_description": "VR\u7d42\u6975\u7269\u7406\u65b9\u584a\u6311\u6230\uff01\u6e96\u5099\u597d\u8fce\u63a5\u4ee4\u4eba\u4e0a\u766e\u7684\u76ca\u667a\u9ad4\u9a57\u3002\u6b65\u5165\u865b\u64ec\u74b0\u5883\uff0c\u901a\u904e\u7cbe\u6e96\u63a8\u79fb\u65b9\u584a\u4f86\u6e05\u7406\u68cb\u76e4\u3002\u7279\u8272\uff1a\u89e3\u58d3\u7684\u7269\u7406\u56de\u994b\u3001\u71d2\u8166\u7684\u95dc\u5361\u8a2d\u8a08\u3001\u6c89\u6d78\u5f0f\u684c\u9762\u98a8\u683c\u4ee5\u53ca\u5b8c\u7f8e\u7684 Meta Quest \u63a7\u5236\u9ad4\u9a57\u3002", "short_description": "\u63a8\u958b\u3001\u6ed1\u52d5\u3001\u89e3\u6c7a\uff01\u5728\u300aPush Em All!\u300b\u4e2d\uff0c\u63a7\u5236\u5f37\u529b\u63a8\u687f\u6e05\u7406\u7db2\u683c\u3002\u904b\u7528\u7b56\u7565\u548c\u7269\u7406\u539f\u7406\u5c07\u65b9\u584a\u63a8\u5165\u76ee\u6a19\u69fd\u4f4d\u3002\u4f60\u80fd\u6e05\u7a7a\u68cb\u76e4\u4e26\u8d0f\u5f97\u734e\u676f\u55ce\uff1f"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "926154206997436", "locale": "el_GR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Push Em All! Clear the Blocks", "keywords": ["\u03bc\u03c0\u03bb\u03bf\u03ba", "\u03c0\u03b1\u03b6\u03bb", "\u03c4\u03b1\u03bc\u03c0\u03bb\u03cc", "\u03bc\u03c5\u03b1\u03bb\u03cc", "\u03c6\u03c5\u03c3\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae"], "long_description": "\u0397 \u03b1\u03c0\u03cc\u03bb\u03c5\u03c4\u03b7 \u03c0\u03c1\u03cc\u03ba\u03bb\u03b7\u03c3\u03b7 \u03bc\u03c0\u03bb\u03bf\u0